{"concept":"circle","groups":[{"id":"curves-and-circuits","name":{"ru":"Кривизна, круги и круговое движение","en":"Curvature, circles and circling"},"count":20},{"id":"time-circle","name":{"ru":"Круг и кривая вечности","en":"The circle and eternity’s curve"},"count":3},{"id":"birth-homograph","name":{"ru":"Омограф родовых схваток","en":"The labour homograph"},"count":1}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bafc518840cda4af3ce9098305fdb45e","tos.text-unit.sid-bafc518840cda4af3ce9098305fdb45e"]},"form":"Kreisen","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["great-noon","identity","attention","ring","animals"],"line":{"ru":"Полдень открывает союз кружащего орла и обвившей его змеи.","en":"Noon reveals the bond of the circling eagle and coiled snake."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-26a1ee6e87794099968ab1335aa260c2","tos.text-unit.sid-26a1ee6e87794099968ab1335aa260c2"]},"form":"krummen","speaker":"sleep-sage","addressee":"young-listeners","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["will","sleep-sage"],"line":{"ru":"Хороший сон у мудреца требует послушания даже хромому начальству.","en":"For the sage, good sleep requires obedience even to crooked authority."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-569f2bbd7c7f34d53bc310b5d8f4fdc5","tos.text-unit.sid-569f2bbd7c7f34d53bc310b5d8f4fdc5"]},"form":"krümmen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["courage","becoming","loneliness","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Одиночество способно утомить гордость и мужество.","en":"Solitude can weary pride and courage."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f6bcad8ba382b898c91b0dcc9da23b97","tos.text-unit.sid-f6bcad8ba382b898c91b0dcc9da23b97"]},"form":"krumm","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Мысль Бога испытывается вопросом об исчезновении времени.","en":"The thought of God is tested through the question of time’s disappearance."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.09","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1d52dc13a5601f127500df18688b4bac","tos.text-unit.sid-1d52dc13a5601f127500df18688b4bac"]},"form":"kreisen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Много солнц вращается в пустом пространстве, но для Заратустры они молчат.","en":"Many suns revolve in empty space, but they are silent to Zarathustra."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ceedd7c275a70b973a503dfe8c1b1bcf","tos.text-unit.sid-ceedd7c275a70b973a503dfe8c1b1bcf"]},"form":"krummen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["will","becoming","zarathustra","life"],"line":{"ru":"Жизнь говорит, что должна быть борьбой, становлением, целью и противоречием целей.","en":"Life says it must be struggle, becoming, purpose and contradiction of purposes."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8ec3fd64f71300c612ceeaa59b99302a","tos.text-unit.sid-8ec3fd64f71300c612ceeaa59b99302a"]},"form":"krumme","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра любит подбирать то, что на чужих пиршествах падает под стол.","en":"The teacher takes up dropped and despised words."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-40ae6f1839d679c4a2bfd41534583aa6","tos.text-unit.sid-40ae6f1839d679c4a2bfd41534583aa6"]},"form":"krumm","speaker":"dwarf","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"time-circle","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra","dwarf"],"line":{"ru":"Карлик отвечает кривой истиной и кругом времени.","en":"The dwarf answers with crooked truth and time’s circle."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-2db3c906df7a898a7bffc60724c55a0f","tos.text-unit.sid-2db3c906df7a898a7bffc60724c55a0f"]},"form":"gekrümmt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Несокрушимая жизнь получает образ изогнутого маяка.","en":"Invincible life receives the image of a bent lighthouse."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-99eaf5babf23d89283b5a8b1a7ca4064","tos.text-unit.sid-99eaf5babf23d89283b5a8b1a7ca4064"]},"form":"krumm","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["laughter","dance","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Прежний танцор сгибается перед крестом.","en":"The former dancer bends before the cross."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-cc7963e22ba76483a70cc6422c2180f5","tos.text-unit.sid-cc7963e22ba76483a70cc6422c2180f5"]},"form":"gekrümmt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"dream","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Мир изображён волевым деревом, дающим опору усталому.","en":"The world is pictured as a strong-willed tree supporting the weary."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-3875dc08df80ecd066a976d125c2b2f1","tos.text-unit.sid-3875dc08df80ecd066a976d125c2b2f1"]},"form":"Kreise","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель замыкает вокруг себя круги и священные границы и строит хребет из всё более священных гор.","en":"The teacher draws circles and sacred boundaries around himself and builds a range of ever more sacred mountains."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7a6410037894c63525c5a90779cd5e8d","tos.text-unit.sid-7a6410037894c63525c5a90779cd5e8d"]},"form":"Kreise","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Душа настигает себя в самом широком круге.","en":"The soul catches itself in the widest circle."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0f8534033d9eb03f74ac4ffeb7d2bf6f","tos.text-unit.sid-0f8534033d9eb03f74ac4ffeb7d2bf6f"]},"form":"Kreises","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"abysmal-thought","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"time-circle","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель вызывает мысль защитником жизни, страдания и круга.","en":"The teacher summons the thought as advocate of life, suffering and circle."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-aa15ff6b6ae52c43bb05fe7316272249","tos.text-unit.sid-aa15ff6b6ae52c43bb05fe7316272249"]},"form":"Krumm","speaker":"animals","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"time-circle","neighbours":["wheel","eternity","animals"],"line":{"ru":"Звери называют кривую путём вечности, а центр — находящимся всюду.","en":"The animals give eternity a crooked path with a centre everywhere."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-775c110e7e87394efdd02ee7b48b2fdf","tos.text-unit.sid-775c110e7e87394efdd02ee7b48b2fdf"]},"form":"krummen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"life","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Жизнь учит танцора кривым путям.","en":"Life teaches the dancer crooked paths."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e4773abbfcbda81dd8e326c351fb37cf","tos.text-unit.sid-e4773abbfcbda81dd8e326c351fb37cf"]},"form":"Krümmen","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["will","identity","necessity","counterfactual","earth"],"line":{"ru":"Крик помощи приводит учителя к играющему страдание чародею.","en":"The cry for help brings the teacher to a magician performing suffering."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-57a92dcfe92d316cd6c9d273a61e9d0d","tos.text-unit.sid-57a92dcfe92d316cd6c9d273a61e9d0d"]},"form":"krummen","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["great-noon","identity","difference","loneliness"],"line":{"ru":"Полдень приводит странника от жажды к желанию покоя.","en":"Noon leads the traveller from thirst to a desire for rest."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1297710732725414173270861b97a1ef","tos.text-unit.sid-1297710732725414173270861b97a1ef"]},"form":"krumm","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель узнаёт искривлённость даже в людях высшего рода.","en":"The teacher recognizes crookedness even in people of higher kind."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f585907d3c7a54afb3c54d7ec02c99f6","tos.text-unit.sid-f585907d3c7a54afb3c54d7ec02c99f6"]},"form":"kreisst","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"birth-homograph","neighbours":["overman","will","death-of-god","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Гора человеческого будущего готова родить; высшие люди хотят, чтобы жил сверхчеловек.","en":"The mountain of the human future is ready to give birth; the higher men want the overman to live."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-61689620ad4d08df61f10c99303c8a41","tos.text-unit.sid-61689620ad4d08df61f10c99303c8a41"]},"form":"krumm","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["child","innocence-play","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Толпа не знает, что велико, мало, прямо и правдиво, и лжёт по невинности.","en":"The present rabble is attributed an unthinking distortion of truth."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a282d81d29e34778d4acc09c5747cc98","tos.text-unit.sid-a282d81d29e34778d4acc09c5747cc98"]},"form":"Krumm","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["identity","laughter","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Добрые вещи смеются у близкой цели и идут кривым путём.","en":"Good things laugh near their aim and take crooked paths."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-beec14eb0363fdcfa29bcb5a2abf9fa2","tos.text-unit.sid-beec14eb0363fdcfa29bcb5a2abf9fa2"]},"form":"krumme","speaker":"ugliest-man","addressee":"ass","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["child","innocence-play","ugliest-man"],"line":{"ru":"Литания восхваляет ослиную невинность за пределами человеческих оценок.","en":"The litany praises asinine innocence beyond human valuations."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.18","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-44e245e1859feffe4ab16d8a643d13bc","tos.text-unit.sid-44e245e1859feffe4ab16d8a643d13bc"]},"form":"krümmsten","speaker":"conscientious","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"curves-and-circuits","neighbours":["conscientious"],"line":{"ru":"Совестливый защищает кривые пути примером самого учителя.","en":"The conscientious in spirit defends crooked paths through the teacher’s example."}}]}
